        "fields": {
          "notes": "Theory Work published by the University of Texas Press in 1992. Cloth and 2022 paperback ISBNs identify its publication states. The separate 1992 Volume II catalog supplies primary artifact data and awaits a local Work record. Schmandt-Besserat’s token-to-writing sequence is studied as an attributed historical theory."
